  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData",
  "title": "Bad Request Data",
  "status": 400,
  "detail": "the service's input: count: must be at most 255"
}
 400
{
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData",
  "title": "Bad Request Data",
  "status": 400,
  "detail": "the service's input: the input: 'count' is required"
}
 400
{
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData",
  "title": "Bad Request Data",
  "status": 400,
  "detail": "the service's input: the input: 'force' is not a member its schema allows"
}
 400
{
  "id": "urn:ngsi-ld:HydraulicUnit:Press30:Unit1",
  "type": "HydraulicUnit",
  "level": 2,
  "zones": [
    1,
    3
  ],
  "note": {
    "by": "shift B"
  }
}
 200
{
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData",
  "title": "Bad Request Data",
  "status": 400,
  "detail": "the service's input: zones[1]: must be of type integer"
}
 400


03. The second model - Stop gone, SetSpeed's output changed (modifiedAt), the others as they were
=================================================================================================
urn:ngsi-ld:ServiceRegistration:assetChannel:a3bff6b2ef9985f8:260c30320182eebf:Reset
   urn:ngsi-ld:Press:Press30 Press Reset loopback://echo
